.TH COF-VERSION 1 "2026-11-13" "cof 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cof-version \- Print version. (also: \fBcof --version\fR)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
cof version [OPTIONS]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints the installed circuitry-cof package version (also: cof --version).
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
The command failed, or the input was invalid.
.TP
.B 2
A usage error -- an unrecognized option or missing argument.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBcof(1)\fR
